    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23246" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in-flexĭbĭlis</span></b> ,
		e, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>that cannot be bent</i>, <i>inflexible.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: dolor (cervicum), <i>lockjaw</i> = opisthotonos, <i><span class="en">Plin. 28,
				12, 52, § 192</span></i>; cf. <i><span class="en">Cael.
				Aur. Acut. 3, 6, 65</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">judicium,</span>”
				<i>unchangeable</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Sen.
					Ep. 95</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">obstinatio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin. Ep. 10, 97, 3</span></i>
			.</div>
